{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:36:11Z","created_by_operation":"op_7e4359d7749a40eb8d8380fdf3aaf21d","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_1634d253f6758eb84a9ec13893d3bc44540d0943bade947bf17ef5b7f8255ec0","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=evaluation","setting":"robzilla1738/harness-terminal@923f44e64473 snapshot b4ca97a39b361395","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_12c462c86097f71d624f9e67fd3fd3b270c425c7875ff225b2574eaa1be7f8f2","slc_5368acc1aa3dad338f547969ad07b3cb4c031858da1678188c732978bba2de0b","slc_a2e0c43dde5aa8cfaca69f4f87043f15fbcd07b74f0c183184d2dab315093ad4","slc_a355e651c4bcd8f48fcda92ee8b135bd3dda69fd9f64533fde0fc1755faab51a"],"source_ids":["src_0028f77469c653dc80ecd2d75df26e43"],"text":"A 42-agent audit workflow (parallel finders, adversarial verification, synthesis, completeness critic) produced 101 findings with 28 adversarially verified, and reported parity scores such as VT core 90%, input protocols 92%, and tmux commands 85% versus ghostty/tmux.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:36:11Z","updated_by_operation":"op_7e4359d7749a40eb8d8380fdf3aaf21d"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:36:11Z","created_by_operation":"op_7e4359d7749a40eb8d8380fdf3aaf21d","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_17b4253abbac653d1a99289c146b6c999295746a473a54357a5558d34c19ccce","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"robzilla1738/harness-terminal@923f44e64473 snapshot b4ca97a39b361395","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1358490e59207d3482dc3fd2478a0b3f4f6175e008d310269ba425b7f74e4581","slc_ac1b0badcc7675ae4d2c89d648a9417a854f01d8e3e2e2c6c21cb0e8c65c63e7"],"source_ids":["src_df83fd5d596a59f288f6190f4b7438f7"],"text":"The product consists of a GPU terminal engine, a background daemon that owns sessions/splits/scrollback, and a harness-cli, all written in first-party Swift as one self-contained app.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:36:11Z","updated_by_operation":"op_7e4359d7749a40eb8d8380fdf3aaf21d"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:36:11Z","created_by_operation":"op_7e4359d7749a40eb8d8380fdf3aaf21d","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_261b505e60e72cdcb80af4a8a4432ea2b131fec3045972a42d1df6a9cc51779d","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"robzilla1738/harness-terminal@923f44e64473 snapshot b4ca97a39b361395","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_13c9e4f51a4ca09bd73ce0866ee48eb95b24167f20177d706a5d6ca00b18baa2","slc_632d7e16f7a5d1732d6fb5834b4e048e0b95a91d9e3476c179c5b130ae8bb59f","slc_f0527a0e4386ff2fe170b3e194faf7d2a3dbc68166a1ed64a5636cbd1332573c"],"source_ids":["src_df83fd5d596a59f288f6190f4b7438f7"],"text":"harness-cli exposes commands such as list-surfaces, new-session, new-tab, send-keys, notify, capture-pane, color-check, and theme-preview, and can be installed onto PATH from the app bundle or a source build.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:36:11Z","updated_by_operation":"op_7e4359d7749a40eb8d8380fdf3aaf21d"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:36:11Z","created_by_operation":"op_7e4359d7749a40eb8d8380fdf3aaf21d","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_27188dabee1e60b6f804f6a09a8e4c807274279b8f9d53fa413d2a63e6fb5a12","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"robzilla1738/harness-terminal@923f44e64473 snapshot b4ca97a39b361395","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_ac1b0badcc7675ae4d2c89d648a9417a854f01d8e3e2e2c6c21cb0e8c65c63e7"],"source_ids":["src_df83fd5d596a59f288f6190f4b7438f7"],"text":"The only external dependency is Sparkle, the macOS auto-update framework, which is GUI-only per the README.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:36:11Z","updated_by_operation":"op_7e4359d7749a40eb8d8380fdf3aaf21d"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:36:11Z","created_by_operation":"op_7e4359d7749a40eb8d8380fdf3aaf21d","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_27eaee531bfc71a17a05c10cf1ee4d54881000b8961357400e35f8b4b2bc3552","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"robzilla1738/harness-terminal@923f44e64473 snapshot b4ca97a39b361395","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_81c6ef40d34cc2898989eaff752ef11ca943ad5079ec836d9de304c4eabeec3d"],"source_ids":["src_0028f77469c653dc80ecd2d75df26e43"],"text":"The audit roadmap states the daemon uses single-lock serialization as a documented correctness invariant, and the daemon control socket is secured with 0o600 permissions plus a peer-UID check; OSC 52 clipboard reads are silently refused.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:36:11Z","updated_by_operation":"op_7e4359d7749a40eb8d8380fdf3aaf21d"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:36:11Z","created_by_operation":"op_7e4359d7749a40eb8d8380fdf3aaf21d","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_37247f9beba8fcb9b424bd24135fc61bd237cfa87911425f4deff8ca3872c797","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"robzilla1738/harness-terminal@923f44e64473 snapshot b4ca97a39b361395","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_6302d776c17aa22dfa84029fe3b82236ccaf360d4a2a8e744513461040c4bd8f","slc_70cb219577edf64e7f7f7f3849dfc7f83c3a717fbf60691885fc204a56b3f2b3","slc_b4804a4b569c6ecb568a9b8aefe4db4b1c84cac54b6a1f0c53ab0155a02dc97a"],"source_ids":["src_df83fd5d596a59f288f6190f4b7438f7"],"text":"HARNESS_SURFACE is set in every Harness pane so agents can notify the exact tab they run in, and 'harness-cli install-hooks claude-code' installs per-agent hooks; agents without hook support fall back to built-in activity detection.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:36:11Z","updated_by_operation":"op_7e4359d7749a40eb8d8380fdf3aaf21d"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:36:11Z","created_by_operation":"op_7e4359d7749a40eb8d8380fdf3aaf21d","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_554ab49f5056dba5cfe068fe0b3f70a93c6d2c6b583f41c20a818cbd17676707","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"robzilla1738/harness-terminal@923f44e64473 snapshot b4ca97a39b361395","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_5b9e99c959fa4efc94622c01e8172ec8a60e3a334c5fea3c9c574a7fe2d3035e","slc_8a358a1c6bf7c6920e1c7648805a4050e8f44506c8390add653a9aff0ba10a9a"],"source_ids":["src_df83fd5d596a59f288f6190f4b7438f7"],"text":"Four experience modes are offered: Plain Terminal (sessions close on quit), Persistent Terminal, Full Terminal (prefix, status line, copy mode, paste buffers, full CLI), and Agent Workspace with detection and notifications enabled up front; new installs start in Plain.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:36:11Z","updated_by_operation":"op_7e4359d7749a40eb8d8380fdf3aaf21d"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:36:11Z","created_by_operation":"op_7e4359d7749a40eb8d8380fdf3aaf21d","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_6287023967a7768b3a4b4772c5c6f75eccb93667b2eaf2d0a0687c471bc8f245","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"robzilla1738/harness-terminal@923f44e64473 snapshot b4ca97a39b361395","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_f324d097076a166f24645e58141351bd0e6a598cec1efcc2f962e5ea4fac4d7d"],"source_ids":["src_df83fd5d596a59f288f6190f4b7438f7"],"text":"Repository development practice: Harness.xcodeproj is generated from project.yml via XcodeGen, and the app target bundles HarnessDaemon and harness-cli into the app's MacOS directory so Xcode runs match the release layout.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:36:11Z","updated_by_operation":"op_7e4359d7749a40eb8d8380fdf3aaf21d"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:36:11Z","created_by_operation":"op_7e4359d7749a40eb8d8380fdf3aaf21d","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_81d61ef732659003886a59996f86a6b7832915a08f68cf51a0e5a23cb08c3302","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"robzilla1738/harness-terminal@923f44e64473 snapshot b4ca97a39b361395","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_022e6e6d89e96b0a6db91bb60255268ab2a43728e39a8a5ca526fd3722f23755","slc_025239d128d8cb872cd0fec8bb30228e9162044e59695a6f09996ba88b2b7188","slc_a84b9e1bde754c3276d15c67934da501b984e99b72d58b6653efe25ab86f88fc","slc_b809bc7f2d4b539a38480af285c24b3bf1ba74c238a5d6ee25c62241e5de63d0","slc_b8c50a22da4f072c071568febc564d359c7bf3d508922fadb71c90adce3e6a51"],"source_ids":["src_0028f77469c653dc80ecd2d75df26e43"],"text":"The audit identified gaps later fixed via shipped PRs, including a paste escape-injection bug, missing DECSTR/REP/IRM/DECOM handlers, DCS misrouting into the Sixel decoder, and Kitty graphics being display-only; animation (a=a) and iTerm2 multipart upload remain deliberately deferred.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:36:11Z","updated_by_operation":"op_7e4359d7749a40eb8d8380fdf3aaf21d"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:36:11Z","created_by_operation":"op_7e4359d7749a40eb8d8380fdf3aaf21d","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_90d3b8925815020f79f9825b279882d53aaec44863bdc1c977f7334035f8c52c","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"robzilla1738/harness-terminal@923f44e64473 snapshot b4ca97a39b361395","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_07114fd1d171bf966e8e43df47e44d0599278ca6efa1ac69b943d6947f38c85b","slc_077ee0a413f92537fac5cdd3e81fbd0b9f637c18edbab00bc4193d69a8ca7bbc","slc_f04eed2344d0c570b37fe8e996420a80083f600725281593f573f3b4217b36f7"],"source_ids":["src_df83fd5d596a59f288f6190f4b7438f7"],"text":"Repository development practice: contributors build with 'make release' or swift build, run 'swift test' plus HARNESS_LIVE_DAEMON_TESTS=1 for real socket/PTY tests, and CI runs the deterministic suite, live daemon tests, and a release build on every push.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:36:11Z","updated_by_operation":"op_7e4359d7749a40eb8d8380fdf3aaf21d"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:36:11Z","created_by_operation":"op_7e4359d7749a40eb8d8380fdf3aaf21d","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_b017e9da4456ae0d374087939540d099f3cf663c1985cb3c681de87682ed5dee","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"robzilla1738/harness-terminal@923f44e64473 snapshot b4ca97a39b361395","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_31e7c36e8b4312794a2a570c2d9a68d2356ac1aebbe1ce0002674169a83ba153","slc_b57b6e7337381d6b1cd8abb6d33413080332dee7d8c17da7f2c2e61b869a0d06","slc_fae2d7ea4f8395edb3e2dc661c953791865c3f900a29b428dc2fe13490d2cd32"],"source_ids":["src_df83fd5d596a59f288f6190f4b7438f7"],"text":"Any harness-cli command accepts a global --host flag to target a headless or remote daemon over an SSH tunnel that forwards the remote control socket, reusing existing SSH trust; remotes are registered with 'remote add' and extra SSH options pass via --ssh-arg.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:36:11Z","updated_by_operation":"op_7e4359d7749a40eb8d8380fdf3aaf21d"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:36:11Z","created_by_operation":"op_7e4359d7749a40eb8d8380fdf3aaf21d","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_d1d1e347261ce7ec9a3abcc7810dd35b25399a372e5f523df18909ef27338ce9","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"robzilla1738/harness-terminal@923f44e64473 snapshot b4ca97a39b361395","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1358490e59207d3482dc3fd2478a0b3f4f6175e008d310269ba425b7f74e4581","slc_554844b995ce283337c35dfa4f400ed8290d768052719091996069275b47cb5d"],"source_ids":["src_df83fd5d596a59f288f6190f4b7438f7"],"text":"Harness detects agents like Claude Code, Codex, and Cursor by their process tree, shows which session runs what, and notifies when an agent stops or requests approval; Cmd+Shift+U jumps to the waiting agent.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:36:11Z","updated_by_operation":"op_7e4359d7749a40eb8d8380fdf3aaf21d"}
